ars in print, it remains the main book on this important topic.\r\n\r\n“Opens the doors to a new energetic psychology,” says Deepak Chopra, through which we can go beyond emotional suffering and bring in the benefic powers of the greater universe of awareness."},"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"pagination":"346 p. :","classifications":{},"source_records":["ia:ayurvedamindheal00fraw","marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run05.mrc:105190309:2973","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part25.utf8:122914280:747","bwb:9780914955368"],"title":"Ayurveda and the mind","lccn":["96080088"],"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Includes bibliographical references (p. 332-333) and index.\r\n\"Sanskrit glossary\": p. 326-328."},"identifiers":{"goodreads":["928542"],"librarything":["851954"]},"edition_name":"1st ed.","dewey_decimal_class":["615.5/3"],"isbn_10":["0914955365"],"publish_date":"1997","publish_country":"wiu","by_statement":"David Frawley.","oclc_numbers":["37390616"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL555603W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"latest_revision":12,"revision":12,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2023-08-17T02:39:36.978725"}}},"ISBN:9788120815216":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9788120815216","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL23079602M/Ayurveda_and_the_mind","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL23079602M/Ayurveda_and_the_mind","details":{"publishers":["Motilal Banarsidass"],"number_of_pages":346,"subtitle":"the healing of consciousness","isbn_10":["8120815211"],"local_id":["urn:sfpl:31223073678949"],"lc_classifications":["R605 .F7 1998"],"latest_revision":5,"key":"/books/OL23079602M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL40943A","name":"David Frawley"}],"publish_places":["Delhi"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"pagination":"346 p. :","source_records":["marc:SanFranPL14/SanFranPL14.out:20843381:1175","marc:marc_openli